<title>NETHERLANDS: DSM moves finance activities from Belgium.</title>
<headline>DSM moves finance activities from Belgium.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch chemicals group DSM NV said on Thursday it would transfer its finance activities to the Netherlands from Belgium.</p>
<p>&quot;The changes in the corporate tax law from January 1, 1997 for business activities in the Netherlands have resulted in this decision,&quot; DSM said in a statement.</p>
<p>DSM had opened the finance coordination office in Belgium in the eighties.</p>
<p>The 20 staff employed at DSM Intra Services NV in Genk, Belgium, will be transferred to Heerlen in the Netherlands.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
